---

### 1. Payroll & Pay Schedules
- **Pay Period:** Salary is paid **monthly** on the **last working day of each calendar month**.  
- **Direct Deposit:** All payouts are processed electronically to the bank account you have on file with the Finance team (Marcus Vance’s team).

---

### 2. Health Insurance & Wellness Program
- **Health Coverage:**  
  - All **full‑time employees** become eligible for the company’s comprehensive health plan **starting on the first calendar day of the month following your hire date**.  
- **Wellness Allowance:**  
  - You receive a **$100 USD (or equivalent local currency) monthly stipend**.  
  - This can be used for **gym memberships, mental‑health counseling apps, ergonomic office supplies, etc.**  
  - **Reimbursement Process:** Submit a claim through the Finance Portal **by the 20th of each month**, attaching valid receipts.

---

### 3. General Expense Reimbursements
- All expense reimbursements (including the wellness stipend) must be filed through the **Finance Portal** with appropriate documentation (receipts, approval if required).  
- Claims submitted after the 20th of the month will be processed in the following month’s payroll cycle.

---

### How to Use This Information
- **If you’re a new hire:** Expect your health coverage to start the month after you begin, and you’ll start receiving the wellness stipend from that same month.  
- **If you’re filing a reimbursement:** Log into the Finance Portal, upload receipts, and ensure submission before the 20th to receive the reimbursement on time.  
- **If you have payroll questions:** Remember that payday is the last working day of each month; verify your direct‑deposit details with the finance team to avoid delays.

---

If you need more detail on any specific part (e.g., additional benefits, expense categories, or the claim submission steps), just let me know!
